Fill arguments for `web_visual_scout`:

- question (optional): a short question to focus the prose scout (e.g., "Describe the restaurant menu UI and any carousels").
- full_page (optional): true only if you need below-the-fold elements; default false.

Return JSON like:
{
  "tool_name": "web_visual_scout",
  "arguments": {
    "question": "Describe the page and any blockers. Do NOT give coordinates.",
    "full_page": false
  }
}

